# Disposable per-frame PNG dumps used only to assemble campaign/*-film/*.mp4 via ffmpeg —
# hundreds of MB of throwaway rendering intermediates, not source and not the deliverable
# (the .mp4 itself is what ships). Caught once already bloating a commit by ~700MB; this
# stops it from happening again on the next render pass.
campaign/*-film/frames-*/
